Dialogue: 10,0:21:51.79,0:21:53.50,Default,Kuni,0,0,0,,Hightail it over to the detective agency.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.85,0:21:53.50,TEXT-JP-ja,,0,0,0,,Come to the detective agency quickly.
